<title>UK: Ventspils crude pipeline closed for maintenance.</title>
<headline>Ventspils crude pipeline closed for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A crude oil pipeline serving the Latvian Baltic port of Ventspils closed early on Tuesday, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>The pipeline, which carries Russian Urals crude, shut at 0910 local time for routine maintenance and would reopen at around 1900 local time, the sources said.</p>
<p>They said the pipeline would shut again on Wednesday for further maintenance but would reopen later the same day.</p>
<p>One 80,000 tonne crude tanker was reported to be berthed at the port waiting to load.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7714</p>
